        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Making of the Representative for Planet 8\n- Projects: Canopus in Argos\n- Organizations: Canopus\n- Places: Planet 8, Carina\n- Concepts: ice age, galactic empire, stars\n\nFacts:\n- The Making of the Representative for Planet 8 is the fourth book in the five-book Canopus in Argos series.\n- The Making of the Representative for Planet 8 describes the fate of Planet 8 under the care of the benevolent galactic empire Canopus.\n- Planet 8 is plunged into an ice age in The Making of the Representative for Planet 8.\n- Canopus is also designated Alpha Carinae, abbreviated Alpha Car or α Car.\n- Canopus is the brightest star in the southern constellation of Carina.\n- Canopus is the second-brightest star in the night-time sky after Sirius.",
